":"KJA to Phytomedicine Pivot: GiEVs & miR-339-3p","target":"KJA to Phytomedicine Pivot: GiEVs & miR-339-3p","line":12},{"title":"原始稿件草案","target":"_inbox/KJA/KJA-S-26-00422.pdf","line":46},{"title":"任務進度追蹤","target":"_inbox/tasks.md","line":47}],"metadata":{"type":"academic","status":null,"tags":null,"BG":"Ginger-derived extracellular vesicles (GiEVs) carrying miR-339-3p attenuate aspiration-induced lung injury (ALI).","GAP":"KJA Editor pointed out lacking survival data, long-term follow-up, and questioned the novelty/anti-inflammatory evidence of miR-339-3p.","RQ":"Do GiEVs significantly improve 48h/long-term survival and pulmonary integrity via miR-339-3p mediated anti-inflammatory pathways in ALI?","METH":"C57BL/6 mice, oropharyngeal aspiration model, GiEV treatment (1x10^9), survival analysis, lung function, BALF WBC, miR-339-3p inhibition.","CONTRI":"Demonstrating trans-kingdom regulation of lung inflammation by plant-derived EVs; providing necessary survival metrics for clinical translation."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[42,45]]},"smart_blocks:100_Research/02_Active/KJA_to_Phytomedicine_Pivot.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":"zu36fm","at":1777503078756},"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.07698793,-0.02287159,0.03067155,0.03299123,0.06122433,-0.00391825,0.02639486,0.07545023,-0.03406243,0.06074838,0.00514001,-0.07871462,0.02519097,0.00218591,0.03584294,0.02578037,0.01853509,0.02235248,-0.15246686,0.03148836,-0.005696,-0.02878138,0.07103152,0.00386905,0.0497389,0.01358375,-0.00829337,-0.03903966,-0.04187429,-0.21343261,-0.05080361,-0.00485983,0.03690203,0.01635787,-0.04769185,0.00665691,-0.06855162,0.04655809,-0.044673,0.0734832,0.06252776,0.02467618,-0.0045726,0.03440479,0.00929572,-0.0187608,-0.0542987,-0.03566618,0.0027033,-0.05480057,0.02219735,-0.01173842,0.01626791,0.04149483,-0.00503897,0.01974906,0.06276268,0.04878215,0.00243208,-0.01101405,0.04318592,0.02063807,-0.19470729,0.0604288,0.0273402,-0